-- Raid spawn masks: most WotLK and Cataclysm raid spawns had spawnMask 8 (10-player normal only), so 25-player
-- and heroic were nearly empty. Each SkyFire spawn gets the mask of the matching spawn (same entry within 5 yards) in:
--   1. Legends of Azeroth Pandaria 5.4.8 (GPL v2), world DB of 2024-07-22
--   2. TrinityCore TDB 3.3.5 (WotLK raids; masks 1/2/4/8 shifted to 8/16/32/64) or TDB 4.4.2 (Cataclysm raids), GPL v2
-- Spawns neither source has: the mask LoA gives every spawn of that entry on the map; if LoA never spawns that entry
-- there, the map's full mask (SkyFire's own encounter pieces and triggers). Spawns LoA disables (mask 0) or that LoA
-- spawns with mixed masks keep mask 8. Masks are cut to the map's difficulties (MapDifficulty.dbc: Onyxia, Naxxramas,
-- Ulduar, Obsidian Sanctum, Eye of Eternity, Vault of Archavon 10/25 normal = 24; the others 10/25 normal+heroic = 120).
-- Only spawns that are mask 8 now change. Icecrown Citadel (631) is done in older_instances_icecrown_citadel.sql.
-- Generated by skyfire_port_plan/tools/raidmasks.py. No database names; safe to run twice.

-- Onyxia's Lair (249) creature
UPDATE `creature` SET `spawnMask` = 24 WHERE `map` = 249 AND `guid` IN (47572, 52047, 52048, 52049, 52050, 52051, 52052, 52053);
